				"type": "ContractRow[]",
				"required": true,
				"description": "Prepared rows that say something of the whole contract, such as purpose, app route or runs as, and are shown above the field tables; rows labelled Inputs, Props, Output, Fails with or Provides are left out because those tables already show them. A function with recorded callable helpers shows no rows here.",
